        {
            "id": "6ef66602-aeb9-4fb0-b5c4-f25ac131cb67",
            "build_id": "55c665b8-d677-4018-84cc-49d1f21c349e",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-03T06:57:26.868712+00:00",
            "notes": "I think  [Launch Vector](item_7d4ef8eb-a008-4f63-802d-a67bd9d6989e) is the way to go, it'll help out the team more in my opinion with extra trickling damage with your HIGH AP.\n\n [Fuel Conversion](item_3a9eb041-da45-4df3-83ed-6d62fd58e5df) works too if you just want to focus on barraging twice as much.  Technically you shouldn't really be using too much fuel to stay in the air because you might get picked out with this build.  Pharah just seems a bit weak in my opinion this season.\n\nI chose  [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) because it sounds like a really good to stay alive per life.  But you can prettty much choose anything else, maybe even  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) to slow them down.\n [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) for all around damage/lifesteal plus overheal.\n\nWell that completes it!  I hope you enjoyed this build as much as I did!  This is my first build or guide that I ever created for Stadium or any game at all.  Let me know how you like or hated it in the comments!  Or a different approach!  I'm open to making this build better!",
